    "probe_text": "Here is the complete ordered list of everything that happens when creating an owner via `POST /api/owners`. The handler is `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner` (`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java:173`).\n\n## Phase 0 \u2014 Before the handler body runs\n\n1. **Authorization** \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")` requires authority `ROLE_OWNER_ADMIN` (only enforced when `petclinic.security.enable=true`). Failure \u2192 403.\n2. **Bean Validation on the request DTO** (`OwnerFieldsDto`, via `@Valid`/`@Validated`). Any violation \u2192 400. Constraints:\n   - `firstName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..30)`, `@Pattern(\"^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}$\")`\n   - `lastName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..30)`, `@Pattern(\"^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}\\.?$\")`\n   - `address` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..255)`\n   - `city` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..80)`\n   - `telephone` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..20)`\n   - `email` \u2014 `@Size(max 255)` (optional)\n   - `postcode` \u2014 `@Pattern(\"^[0-9]{4}$\")` (optional)\n   - `registrationDate`, `birthDate` \u2014 `@Valid` (optional)\n   - `sharesHousehold` \u2014 no constraint (request-only)\n\n## Phase 1 \u2014 Handler body, in exact execution order\n\n3. **Normalize address** (`AddressNormalizer.normalize`) \u2014 trim, collapse whitespace, uppercase, expand `ST\u2192STREET`/`RD\u2192ROAD`/`AVE\u2192AVENUE`; null/blank \u2192 `\"\"`. *(mutation)*\n4. **Validate required fields** (`validateRequiredFields`) \u2014 `firstName, lastName, address, city, telephone` must be non-blank (address checked *after* normalization) \u2192 else `MissingOwnerFieldsException` (400).\n5. **Validate postcode** (`validatePostcode`) \u2014 if present, must match `^[0-9]{4}$` and `OwnerLocality.postcodeMatchesCity(postcode, city)` \u2192 else `InvalidOwnerFieldsException` (400).\n6. **Map DTO \u2192 `Owner` entity** (`ownerMapper.toOwner`, MapStruct; ignores `id` and `pets`).\n7. **Normalize telephone** (`TelephoneNormalizer.normalize`) \u2014 strip separators, apply `+61` default / drop leading `0`, must match `^\\+[0-9]{8,15}$`, plus per-country length check (`+61`\u21929, `+1`\u219210) \u2192 else `InvalidOwnerFieldsException` (400). *(mutation)*\n8. **Normalize email** (`normalizeEmail`) \u2014 if present, must match email regex, lowercase it, reject disposable domains (`mailinator.com`, `tempmail.com`, `guerrillamail.com`) \u2192 else `InvalidOwnerFieldsException` (400). *(mutation)*\n9. **Validate registration date** (`validateRegistrationDate`) \u2014 if present and after today \u2192 `InvalidOwnerFieldsException` (400).\n10. **Default registration date** \u2014 if null, set to `LocalDate.now()`. *(mutation)*\n11. **Roll to business day** (`toBusinessDay`) \u2014 if Sat/Sun, advance to Monday. *(mutation)*\n12. **Compute `sharesHousehold` flag** \u2014 `Boolean.TRUE.equals(dto.getSharesHousehold())`.\n13. **Set `householdId`** (`HouseholdNormalizer.householdId`) \u2014 SHA-256(normalized lastName + `\"|\"` + postcode), first 12 hex chars. *(mutation)*\n14. **Set `identityKey`** (`buildIdentityKey`) \u2014 `telephone|email|householdId`. *(mutation)*\n15. **Household duplicate rejection** \u2014 if *not* sharesHousehold, scan `findAllOwners()`; any matching `householdId` \u2192 `DuplicateOwnerIdentityException` (409).\n16. **Soft-duplicate detection** (`findPossibleDuplicate`) \u2014 if not sharesHousehold and postcode present, find earliest existing owner with same lastName + postcode but different telephone; set `possibleDuplicate` / `possibleDuplicateOf`. *(mutation; does not block)*\n17. **City capacity check** (`countOwnersInCity`) \u2014 if `>= 50` (`CITY_OWNER_LIMIT`) \u2192 `OwnerCityFullException` (409).\n18. **Daily limit check** (`countOwnersRegisteredOn`) \u2014 if `>= 100` (`DAILY_OWNER_LIMIT`) \u2192 `OwnerDailyLimitException` (429).\n19. **Bulk-signup warning flag** \u2014 set if day count `> 80` (`BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD`); response-only.\n20. **Set `customerCode`** (`buildCustomerCode`) \u2014 region (`OwnerLocality`) + SHA-256(telephone+lastName) \u2192 `REGION-<8 hex>`. *(mutation)*\n21. **Set `namesakeCount`** (`countNamesakes`) \u2014 count owners with same first+last name. *(mutation)*\n22. **Set `householdSize`** (`countHouseholdMembers` + 1). *(mutation)*\n23. **Persist** \u2014 `clinicService.saveOwner(owner)` \u2192 `ownerRepository.save` inside `@Transactional` (plain insert; no DB unique constraints).\n24. **Audit log** \u2014 SLF4J `AUDIT` logger info line with id, customerCode, registrationDate, membershipLevel. *(side-effect: logging only)*\n25. **Map entity \u2192 `OwnerDto`** (`toOwnerDto`; derives displayName, initials, checkDigit, membershipNumber/level/points, locality, etc.), set `bulkSignupWarning`, set `Location: /api/owners/{id}` header, return **201 CREATED**.\n\n## Notable points\n\n- **All uniqueness/limit checks are in-application full scans** of `findAllOwners()` (steps 15\u201318, 21\u201322) \u2014 there are **no** DB `unique`/`nullable` constraints, no `@PrePersist`/`@PreUpdate`, no entity listeners, and the entity's own Bean Validation annotations (`Owner`/`Person`) are **not** exercised on this path.\n- **No application events** are published; the only \"audit\" is the log line. No password encoding occurs here.\n- `findByTelephone` exists on the repository but is **not** used in the create path."
